@context: Region qualifiers and the diagnostic verbs — SCREENSHOT, HIGHLIGHT, FULL SCAN, SCAN PAGE, VERIFY VISUAL.
@title: diagnostics
@tags: regression, diagnostics
@import: OpenDashboard from 'lib/auth.hunt'

STEP 1: Qualifiers
    USE OpenDashboard
    CLICK the 'Terms' link ON FOOTER
    CLICK the 'Edit' button INSIDE 'Users'
    VERIFY that 'Editing Ada Lovelace' is present
    CLICK the 'Delete' button INSIDE 'Users' row with 'Alan Turing'
    VERIFY that 'Deleted Alan Turing' is present
    VERIFY that 'Version 0.1.6' is present

STEP 2: Look at the page
    HIGHLIGHT the 'Order total'
    SCREENSHOT "dashboard"
    FULL SCAN
    SCAN PAGE into {reports/scanned_dashboard.hunt}
    VERIFY VISUAL 'MANUL'

STEP 3: Leave via the header
    CLICK the 'Widgets' link ON HEADER
    VERIFY that 'Signature' is present

DONE.
